WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.048
A recipe can travel farther than the person who first made it.

00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:14.196
Around a table, memories are passed from one person to another. A familiar taste can make a new place feel like home.

00:00:15.046 --> 00:00:23.149
This visual poem imagines food as a meeting point. It belongs to Miami's gateway as an editorial association.

00:00:23.999 --> 00:00:31.227
The images are abstract. No real restaurant, chef, or traditional recipe is represented.

